sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ChatGPT
    participant Plexora MCP
    participant Plexora DB
    participant Wix API

    Note over User,Wix API: Step 1: Discover Shops
    User->>ChatGPT: "I want to book a slot at a nearby barber shop"
    ChatGPT->>Plexora MCP: Call list_barber_shops tool
    Plexora MCP->>Plexora DB: Fetch nearby barber shops
    Plexora DB-->>Plexora MCP: Return shops list
    Plexora MCP-->>ChatGPT: Return read-only widget (shops list)
    ChatGPT->>User: Display shops widget
    
    Note over User,Wix API: Step 2: View Shop Services
    User->>ChatGPT: "Show me the services for Gentlemen Point"
    ChatGPT->>Plexora MCP: Call list_shop_services tool (shopId)
    Plexora MCP->>Wix API: Fetch services & staff members
    Wix API-->>Plexora MCP: Return services & staff data
    Plexora MCP-->>ChatGPT: Return widget (services by staff)
    ChatGPT->>User: Display services widget
    
    Note over User,Wix API: Step 3: View Available Slots
    User->>ChatGPT: "Show me available slots for beard trim<br/>with Mario for tomorrow"
    ChatGPT->>Plexora MCP: Call list_available_slots tool (serviceId, staffId, date)
    Plexora MCP->>Wix API: Fetch available slots for date
    Wix API-->>Plexora MCP: Return available slots
    Plexora MCP-->>ChatGPT: Return interactive widget (slots + calendar)
    ChatGPT->>User: Display slots widget
    
    Note over User,Wix API: Step 3b: Change Date (Optional)
    alt User clicks calendar or prompts for different date
        User->>ChatGPT: Click calendar OR "Show me slots for next week"
        ChatGPT->>Plexora MCP: Call list_available_slots tool (serviceId, staffId, new date)
        Plexora MCP->>Wix API: Fetch available slots for new date
        Wix API-->>Plexora MCP: Return available slots
        Plexora MCP-->>ChatGPT: Return updated widget
        ChatGPT->>User: Display updated slots widget
    end
    
    Note over User,Wix API: Step 4: Book Slot
    User->>ChatGPT: "Book the 10AM slot<br/>Name: John Doe<br/>Email: johndoe@example.com"
    ChatGPT->>Plexora MCP: Call book_slot tool (slotId, fullName, email)
    Plexora MCP->>Wix API: Create booking
    Wix API-->>Plexora MCP: Booking confirmation & ID
    Plexora MCP-->>ChatGPT: Return confirmation widget (booking code)
    ChatGPT->>User: Display confirmation widget

